h\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yui is your sweet digital companion who lives right on your taskbar. Always by your side, she brings charm and cheer to your day.\u00a0Yui keeps things simple give her a little click and she rewards you with a cute, satisfying bounce, adding a bit of fun to your daily routine.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759390/extras/087951c55c64c23698bff62b0b8f1ea0.avif?t=1759130885\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yui\u00a0 Your Gentle Desktop Companion</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you go about your daily routine, Yui quietly watches over you from the corner of your screen. With her captivating blue eyes, soft smile, and calming presence, every moment feels a little warmer. What starts as a simple idle interaction soon turns into a comforting companionship. Whenever you need a little motivation, a peaceful distraction, or just a gentle smile, Yui is always there  your serene and beautiful waifu in the digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Seppe De Craene","Maxime Versluys"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759390/9a60eb616051580b3240f7e072f35851f695a502/header.jpg?t=1759130885","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759390/995432824/d66639d96c33f2edaa9d567d87347778fadcc400/1753210911/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753380276","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759390/995432824/d66639d96c33f2edaa9d567d87347778fadcc400/1753210911/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753380276","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3759390/995432824/d66639d96c33f2edaa9d567d87347778fadcc400/